# Trace data is archived to Trillium, not committed (keeps the repo lean):
#   - raw CTF kernel traces (~4.2 GB across 132 runs)
#   - decoded babeltrace dumps (~962 MB) that the analyzers read
# What IS kept in git per run: meta/ (ground_truth, cpu/mem/io stats,
# clock anchors, enabled events, agent_diff) + agent.log. Dumps regenerate
# from CTF via babeltrace; CTF is reproducible from the collection scripts.
**/trace/kernel/
**/trace.txt.gz
